  "html": "\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">\n</p><div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\"><a name=\"top\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><select data-goto=\"self\" size=\"1\">\n<option selected=\"\">Catalog*********</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/britian/\">브리튼</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/magincia/\">마젠시아</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/minoc/\">미녹</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/moonglow/\">문글로우</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/skara/\">스카라브레이스</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/trinsic/\">트린식</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/buccanee/\">부케니아덴</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/cove/\">코브</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/jhelom/\">젤롬</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/nujelm/\">뉴젤롬</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/ocello/\">오클로</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/serpent/\">셔펜드홀드</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/vesper/\">베스퍼</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/yew/\">유</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/delucia/\">델루시아</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/papua/\">파푸아</option>\n<option>----------------</option>\n<option value=\"/site/skill/tmap/\">보물지도</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/world/\">월드맵</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/ilshenar/\">일쉐나전체지도</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/t2a/\">잃어버린대륙</option>\n</select><img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/map_up.gif\" width=\"200\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/memo_m.gif\" height=\"550\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background.gif\" height=\"30\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/alpha/u.gif\" width=\"30\">O.MAPS</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"1\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/map/illshenar.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"490\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" usemap=\"#ImageMap1\" width=\"540\"></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                            </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">각각의 \n                            던전이름을 누르시면 해당 던전의 상세정보로 보실 \n                            수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">1.  각각의 게이트(겸손,용맹,,정의,정직,희생,숭고함,카오스)에 \n                            있는 Ankh</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>♀</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">지역에서 </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;부활하실 수 있습니다. 명예는 \n                            Ankh</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>♀</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">가 없으므로 부활하실 수 없습니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">2. <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/map/illshenar/mark_7.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"10\">표시 \n                            지역에는 NPC힐러가 있으므로 부활하실 수 있습니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">3. <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/illshenar/mark_6.gif\" width=\"10\">표시 \n                            지역에는 임시 집시캠프로 은행처럼 입출금이 가능합니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(8개의 지역중에 랜덤하게 \n                            발생합니다.)</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">4. <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/illshenar/mark_3.gif\" width=\"11\">표시 \n                            지역에는고정된 상점과 은행입니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">5. <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/illshenar/mark_1.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/illshenar/mark_2.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/map/illshenar/mark_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/illshenar/mark_5.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/map/illshenar/mark_8.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"11\">표시 \n                            지역에는 같은 아이콘끼리 워프되는 포인트입니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(</font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">클릭하시면 상세 이미지를 보실 \n                            수 있습니다</font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">)</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:25;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">6. 중앙의 가고일시티지역은 일쉐나 전체지도의 \n                            중앙이라고 불리워집니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Written By Forg</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><a href=\"#top\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/top_up.gif\" width=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<map name=\"ImageMap1\">\n<area coords=\"68, 68, 165, 96\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Central/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"5, 100, 114, 124\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902133305/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/I_Anciect%20Lair%20II.html\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\">\n<area coords=\"4, 289, 82, 316\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Kirin/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"18, 325, 100, 352\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Wisp/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"32, 365, 131, 393\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Cyclops/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"132, 350, 178, 375\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"69, 395, 168, 411\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902133305/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/I_Rat%20Cave.html\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\">\n<area coords=\"63, 419, 205, 440\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Spidercave/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"75, 466, 211, 486\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902133305/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/I_Mushroom%20Cave.html\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\">\n<area coords=\"385, 455, 518, 471\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Blood_Dungeon/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"406, 432, 511, 449\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Spidercave/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"421, 412, 539, 429\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Rock/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"431, 153, 538, 179\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Serpentine/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"420, 125, 531, 149\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902133305/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/I_Anciect%20Lair%20I.html\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\">\n<area coords=\"384, 104, 539, 121\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"380, 75, 538, 91\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Exodus/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"382, 51, 515, 71\" href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Central/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"314, 11, 417, 38\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902133305/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/I_Sorcerers.html\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\">\n</map>",
